WEBVTT

00:06:58.430 --> 00:07:01.296
moving their headquarters
to the global south

00:07:01.320 --> 00:07:05.340
and urban areas that are most affected
by the climate emergency.

00:07:05.740 --> 00:07:09.886
There should be new scholarships
and bursaries in environmental science

00:07:09.910 --> 00:07:11.681
for people of color.

00:07:11.705 --> 00:07:13.186
Educate yourself.

00:07:13.210 --> 00:07:17.876
Join great movements that recognize
the links between climate and race.

00:07:17.900 --> 00:07:19.066
To name a few,

00:07:19.090 --> 00:07:22.146
the Black Environment Network
and Wretched of the Earth.

00:07:22.170 --> 00:07:23.333
And finally,

00:07:23.357 --> 00:07:28.706
racial injustice and climate injustice
are both rooted in the evil notion

00:07:28.730 --> 00:07:32.386
that some lives
are more important than others.